<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Contact GoodLeaders</title>

<style>
*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
    font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
}

body{
    background:#f4f7fb;
    color:#222;
}

header{
    background:#1e40af;
    color:white;
    padding:20px;
    text-align:center;
}

header h1{
    font-size:30px;
}

.container{
    max-width:900px;
    margin:30px auto;
    padding:20px;
}

.card{
    background:white;
    padding:30px;
    margin-bottom:20px;
    border-radius:15px;
    box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
}

h2{
    color:#1e40af;
    margin-bottom:15px;
}

p{
    line-height:1.7;
    margin-bottom:15px;
}

label{
    display:block;
    font-weight:bold;
    margin-bottom:6px;
}

input,
textarea{
    width:100%;
    padding:13px;
    margin-bottom:18px;
    border:1px solid #ccc;
    border-radius:8px;
    font-size:16px;
}

textarea{
    min-height:140px;
    resize:vertical;
}

button{
    padding:13px 22px;
    background:#2563eb;
    color:white;
    border:none;
    border-radius:8px;
    font-size:16px;
    cursor:pointer;
}

button:hover{
    background:#1d4ed8;
}

.btn{
    display:inline-block;
    margin-top:10px;
    padding:12px 20px;
    background:#2563eb;
    color:white;
    text-decoration:none;
    border-radius:8px;
}

footer{
    background:#1e40af;
    color:white;
    text-align:center;
    padding:25px;
    margin-top:40px;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>

<h1>📩 Contact GoodLeaders</h1>

<p>We would love to hear from you.</p>

</header>

<div class="container">

<div class="card">

<h2>Get In Touch</h2>

<p>
If you have a question, suggestion, feedback or would like to
contact the GoodLeaders team, you can reach us using the form below.
</p>

<form action="/contact" method="POST">

<label>Name</label>

<input
type="text"
name="name"
placeholder="Enter your name"
required>

<label>Email</label>

<input
type="email"
name="email"
placeholder="Enter your email address"
required>

<label>Message</label>

<textarea
name="message"
placeholder="Write your message here..."
required></textarea>

<button type="submit">
📨 Send Message
</button>

</form>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>📧 Contact
